{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321406001:1":{"text":"이런, 누가 조각상 앞에 누워서 이상한 소리를 하고 있어요...","source_cn":"奇怪，冰雕前面怎么躺着个人，还说着乱七八糟的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F6564C5741992C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321406002:1":{"text":"...형! 또 술 마시러 갔던 거지!","source_cn":"——哥哥！你又跑去喝酒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8A46CC383438383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321406003:1":{"text":"네? 쓰러져 있는 사람이 당신의 형이에요?!","source_cn":"哎？倒在地上的这个人就是你哥哥？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E1F98287AE6D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321406004:1":{"text":"맞아요. 술 마시러 갔을 줄 알았어요. 아니면 이렇게 오래 집에 안 돌아왔을 리 없거든요!","source_cn":"是啊。我就猜到他去喝酒了，不然才不会这么久都不回家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0457AD2B2213A78A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321406005:1":{"text":"형, 얼른 일어나. 집에 가야지! 누가 찾아오셨어!","source_cn":"哥哥，快醒醒，该回家了！有人找你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8DA0DDCD3A68F5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen